 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Not really. Many people switch between them, and it helps to know how languages do things differently. That's common early on. Try a few weeks just with one language, then switch. You' notice which habits are yours, not the other way. No rush. Keep it enjoyably relaxed, and you' pick it up naturally. You' welcome. Keep it somewhere you'll see it every day for a few weeks. Then do a little of that every day, like five minutes, and you' start to hear it.",
